I walk to the bus stop.
There are many people on the street.
A red BEST bus arrives.
I board the bus.
There is a huge crowd in the bus today.
I stand near the door.
I hold the metal handrail securely.
The conductor comes near me.
"Sir, I want one ticket," I say.
"Fifteen rupees," the conductor says.
I give fifteen rupees.
He gives me the ticket.
I put that ticket in my bag.
The bus goes fast.
I look outside from the window.
In Mumbai city in the morning, people are very busy.
The shops on the street are open.
Tea sellers are working.
There is a lot of noise everywhere.
Soon my office stop arrives.
